ce41b523e6cea3.webm?t=1764230504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/61c2c07a5b7e8a16e1ce41b523e6cea3.mp4?t=1764230504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0On fire! An alias advertising an attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cool to ridiculous and everything in between--slap on an alias to exponentially evolve your abilities and take your strength to the next level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/1c7518e4291e1632f4204c271d479eb1.poster.avif?t=1764230504\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/1c7518e4291e1632f4204c271d479eb1.webm?t=1764230504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/1c7518e4291e1632f4204c271d479eb1.mp4?t=1764230504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0I'm burnin' up! Join the struggle brother!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you don't like action, Player Two can have fun backing up their buddy at the partner slots and show them some brotherly love!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live streams and gameplay videos? Bring it on!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We permit monetization through video streaming and live broadcasts using this game.</p>","developers":["ZOC Co.,Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/a13fcadfe7ed44cda4d68bbed91f27245412f6a4/header.jpg?t=1764230504","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 ZOC \u3000\u00a92025 D3PUBLISHER","linux_requirements